{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0265_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_04_title", "source_sha256": "057b8d34d6f0281d6d48f1075b2b11456e8e707a74e71ea6abeff577ec946783", "ja": "正解の形", "zh": "正确形式", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0265_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_04_synopsis", "source_sha256": "8c13e7b23e88341270810c09bd373ccce4e05140a70fca948270bb0ac6f2a9d4", "ja": "このみとプロデューサーの気遣いに、心配\nは無用だと答えるまつり。どんなおたより\nにもちゃんと向き合いたいという気持ちを\n尊重し、姉妹仲の悩みについて全員で時間\nいっぱいまで考える事を決意する。", "zh": "对于可奈美和制作人的关心，茉莉回答说不用担心。她尊重大家想认真面对每一封来信的心情，决定和所有人一起，直到时间结束都思考姐妹关系的烦恼。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0265_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_04_1000_p", "source_sha256": "db497c4673f3edcdc6379fb7b9ba9f41b09dd07b11cfbf744b695d439771ebf6", "ja": "よし、追加のおたよりチェックはこれでOKと。\n……お、そろそろ打ち合わせの時間だな。", "zh": "好，追加来信的确认这样就搞定了。\n……哦，差不多到开会的时间了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0265_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_04_1001_p", "source_sha256": "9549eda10304227af13b5c931735aef6c886776c2eef4a9b7a39af6e312d8cbe", "ja": "（もうすぐ、3回目の配信がある。今回の企画は\n期間限定だから、最終回まであっという間だな……）", "zh": "（再过不久就是第3次直播了。这次企划是限时的，转眼就要到最终回了……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0265_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_04_1002_p", "source_sha256": "747cbf91034c790a4af7a99c6a54e51e742fae472554297ed199d98423e12bac", "ja": "ふたりのラジオ配信だけど、好評という事で……\n次の定期公演で、一部、公開録音を行う事になった。", "zh": "虽然是两人的广播直播，不过因为反响很好……\n决定在下一次定期公演中进行部分公开录音。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0265_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_04_1003_p", "source_sha256": "1711a320607339e3803a5d5fb1c412740115e345f13e98fffc75151fd049c3a3", "ja": "新曲のステージもあるから、少し大変だけど。\n注目されている今がチャンスだ、頑張ろう！", "zh": "还有新歌的舞台，虽然会有点辛苦。\n现在正是备受关注的好机会，我们加油吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0265_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_04_1004_039kon", "source_sha256": "0cb66b2a51c1535edf4f71c19e7631e0b4fb3e01f4a83f6fe59725a1d3377e0d", "ja": "気軽に始めたラジオ配信が、\nまさかこんなに話題になるとはって感じね……。", "zh": "没想到随手开始的广播直播，居然会引起这么大的话题……有种这样的感觉呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0265_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_04_1005_021mat", "source_sha256": "14ccddef24556b7f3130f5701993b00cdc17d5f60c1657cca11b13b6895c8913", "ja": "ナイスなタイミングでの、このみちゃんと姫の新曲……\nきっとリスナーのみんなは、大喜びなのです♪", "zh": "在这个绝妙时机推出的木之美和姬的新歌……听众们一定会高兴得不得了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0265_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_04_1006_021mat", "source_sha256": "3f4f8c2e1e3f1b1f720c795e0df9ef3cee39ecf74fe5f16b0e9a68625cfcb7c2", "ja": "ステージも公開録音も、とびきり・わんだほー！な\nイベントにしてみせるのですよ♪", "zh": "我一定会把舞台和公开录音都办成超——棒的活动哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0265_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_04_1007_021mat", "source_sha256": "d1fd6c795791930912a860eb627629593faa174bdb04ad830dc72bcb684d866b", "ja": "それではさっそく、今日もおたよりを……。", "zh": "那么事不宜迟，今天也来读读听众来信……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0265_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_04_1008_p", "source_sha256": "63aacb329960c4c75d0d36cae99be639e84c65ca1db0839d53ff20b858499620", "ja": "あ、まつり。\nその前に、ちょっと話したい事があって……。", "zh": "啊，茉莉。\n在那之前，我有件事想稍微聊一下……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0265_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_04_1009_021mat", "source_sha256": "fc4992837fe5850acbddbb4c574ddad52899b72341cd511bbb155a7a056a31d3", "ja": "ほ？　……もしかして、姉妹仲に悩んでいるっていう、\nあのおたよりのことなのです？", "zh": "嗯？……难道是指那封说自己为姐妹关系烦恼的来信吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0265_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_04_1010_021mat", "source_sha256": "21a237056b47ef0b19a30845accc2bcb79e009def2d984f62f71c33d8539160c", "ja": "もし{$P$}さんとこのみちゃんが\n姫を気遣っているのなら、そういうのは無用なのです。", "zh": "如果{$P$}先生和木实是在担心本公主，那就不必了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0265_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_04_1011_039kon", "source_sha256": "c997af27e2c6b8c416fa8d281688ff74096cf8d8c5eb6a209dc518034cd9d8a8", "ja": "えっ！？\nど、どうしてわかったの……？", "zh": "咦！？\n你、你是怎么知道的……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0265_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_04_1012_021mat", "source_sha256": "87f4367be1f63a2747308f47e91f8a8d31a501acd790916867bc6215f78bdde2", "ja": "おたよりが、姫の担当分から消えていたのです。\nすぐにピンと来たのです。", "zh": "来信从公主负责的那部分里消失了。\n我马上就猜到了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0265_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_04_1013_021mat", "source_sha256": "81bb37a17690d038822e5befecc5fd8c95d12594911a2837e3483f472badf28a", "ja": "このみちゃんと{$P$}さんが\n心配してくれるのは、とってもうれしいのですよ？", "zh": "看到这美和和{$P$}先生为姬担心，姬真的特别开心哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0265_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_04_1014_021mat", "source_sha256": "f19f82a6e9a17e1edf4045fac22bf957fcfbb9ca80817ab8b2acc4138bb3928a", "ja": "でも、お仕事はお仕事。どんなおたよりにも、\n姫はちゃんと答えたいのです。", "zh": "但是，工作就是工作。不管是什么来信，公主都想认真地回复。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0265_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_04_1015_p", "source_sha256": "930cd0216277f4fea71044902b990677d9fc847486f497f7aff3d1e63764ea73", "ja": "そうか……わかった。そういう事なら、\nまつりの考えを尊重するよ。", "zh": "这样啊……我明白了。既然你都这么说了，我会尊重茉莉的想法。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0265_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_04_1016_039kon", "source_sha256": "d0d93e2260b84bb658b9d29706ce2748eb2876e405e8f056da812f37cf058180", "ja": "ごめんなさい、余計なお世話だったわね。\nでも、あのおたより、答えるのが難しい内容よね……。", "zh": "对不起，是我多管闲事了。\n不过，那封来信的内容确实很难回答呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0265_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_04_1017_021mat", "source_sha256": "dba03b15b71aafa02c85791f0fc8933f593827da34ff9dd69cfd7d90b0272da1", "ja": "それには、姫も同感なのです。あのおたよりに\nどう答えればいいかは、ちょっぴり悩んでいるのです。", "zh": "对此，公主也有同感。该怎么回答那封来信，公主也有点苦恼。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0265_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_04_1018_021mat", "source_sha256": "b33c8d0c9e428ba6ca260470b479e186d496f02da6915641cdabedcb6a84a8f3", "ja": "姉妹や兄弟の形……ううん、家族だって、\n形は、人それぞれなのです。", "zh": "姐妹或是兄弟的形式……不，就算是家人，\n形式也是因人而异的哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0265_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_04_1019_039kon", "source_sha256": "ecf91ec8cfa223cc2d5af52880d4a395687fc65291f3595dc2ff02a8fe55df0b", "ja": "そうよね。私は、自分の妹とは、\n仲良くしたいって思うけど……。", "zh": "是啊。我也希望能和自己的妹妹好好相处……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0265_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_04_1020_039kon", "source_sha256": "bf52e9fa4ec414b9b30eb4cb404fd813a96446662b201d87cdf0f50f5e7b8370", "ja": "でもそれは、私の、私だけの気持ち。\n人に押し付けるものじゃないものね。", "zh": "但是，那只是我的、只属于我的想法。\n不能把它强加给别人。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0265_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_04_1021_021mat", "source_sha256": "5634564e985388cf7fe589cbc7eefb9e020958146026012079a346b8d3b74a14", "ja": "……誰だって、仲が良いに越したことはないのです。\nその気持ち自体は、間違っていないはずなのです。", "zh": "……无论对谁来说，关系好总归是件好事。\n这份心情本身，肯定是没有错的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0265_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_04_1022_021mat", "source_sha256": "e2473cca2705bae51bc86cb35427a771bcc5bac332fb977f22c5178db61b1fab", "ja": "このみちゃんは、妹さんと仲良しだって聞いたのです。\nそれは、素敵なことなのですよ。", "zh": "听说，这位小美和妹妹关系很好呢。\n那真是一件美好的事情。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0265_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_04_1023_021mat", "source_sha256": "5f4303065a40edef4382ee8a433eb6ad6f7a88c5e030e8fd1b488f40aa8edec9", "ja": "まつりは、ちょっぴりうらやましいのです。", "zh": "茉莉有点羡慕呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0265_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_04_1024_039kon", "source_sha256": "3565b9793a94f7e4c625774897dec6b46719ac2ca2df181c9f319355c7dffc0c", "ja": "まつりちゃん……。", "zh": "茉莉……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0265_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_04_1025_021mat", "source_sha256": "3ad728e1d7d5ca2c1343a1aa847ace63b78eff4817b500c6583d33f0c52170fd", "ja": "「お姉さんに、仲良くしたいって言ってみたら？」\n……って。言うだけなら、簡単なのです。", "zh": "“试着对姐姐说一句想和她好好相处，怎么样？”\n……之类的话。只是说说的话，那是很简单的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0265_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_04_1026_021mat", "source_sha256": "a638dbff2ef2229b06d3a031f238ce392fede6acdfc1eec607030b3d72d19131", "ja": "でも、配信でそう答えるのは姫も違う気がするのです。\n仲良くできないから、姫達に相談したはずなので……。", "zh": "但是，要让小公主在直播里这样回答，总觉得也不太对劲。\n\n因为对方正是因为没办法和别人好好相处，才会来向小公主们咨询的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0265_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_04_1027_021mat", "source_sha256": "4e01fb1f2de2ac6f126423c0445ab3aede62b86b4cee28b94a00b7255be16a77", "ja": "だから姫は、もうすこし……\nあのおたよりへの答えを、考えたいのです。", "zh": "所以，小公主还想再多……考虑一下该怎么回复那封来信。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0265_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_04_1028_p", "source_sha256": "b2ee3cd44337343e87b9a7beee23cc5f4d022c1b755985926664ebcc37c77859", "ja": "そうだな。全員が難しいと判断したおたよりだし、\n全員で考えよう。今日は保留にするしかないかもな。", "zh": "是啊。毕竟这是大家都觉得很难回答的来信，还是大家一起想想吧。今天或许只能先暂缓了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0265_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_04_1029_039kon", "source_sha256": "e53dabc3581c2d52743790d07de75eac668445264e0a56e0f780088bbf95ed52", "ja": "そうね。まだ配信はあるから、\n紹介するチャンスは残っていると思うし……。", "zh": "是啊。毕竟还有直播，\n我觉得介绍的机会还在……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0265_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_04_1030_021mat", "source_sha256": "591a8897453d9b6ed2a48d843a97d36273c580550223a4221b1da62d56d3f1a1", "ja": "はいなのです。それまでに結論を出せるよう、\n姫も考えるのです！", "zh": "是的。在那之前，为了能得出结论，本公主也会好好思考的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0265_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_04_1031_null", "source_sha256": "efc1d82f27c00c2cd66242ba3968b75b5084f0ad635f478df59f2ea4ca40369e", "ja": "そして……", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0265_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_04_1032_p", "source_sha256": "d51ac52e40347f386c6777c3381003cc44c991896bae86bc237a047c76708e97", "ja": "お疲れさまです、このみさん。\nまだ帰ってなかったんですね？", "zh": "辛苦了，这个位美小姐。\n你还没回去啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0265_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_04_1033_039kon", "source_sha256": "385d827c63b5bdaa9e66437468ec8640bfdd680dd66a570f56761e14839c6dfa", "ja": "ええ、ちょっと考えごとしてたの。\n……ねえ、{$P$}。", "zh": "嗯，我刚才在想些事情。\n……那个，{$P$}。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0265_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_04_1034_039kon", "source_sha256": "3449cf80834cd888a55f34ba53be9026edeb7ac259970b50d19a7a0752f19482", "ja": "まつりちゃん、芯のある子だなと思っていたけど……\n私達の想像より、ずっと大人だったわね。", "zh": "我原以为，茉莉是个很有主见的孩子……\n没想到她比我们想象中成熟得多呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0265_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_04_1035_p", "source_sha256": "5b1831441b781c0a5a189843fdd4f0e9fc6bd1683ae78519c7fbba2f197baf98", "ja": "そうですね。\n俺も驚かされる事が多いです。", "zh": "是啊。我也经常会被她惊到。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0265_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_04_1036_039kon", "source_sha256": "e953ab6d614eb1ff254aa40548db33e3f1d18a5679fbec2a54e633f677d380dc", "ja": "今日だって、気遣いのつもりが、\n危うくお節介になっちゃうところだったし。", "zh": "就像今天，本来是想关心她，差点就变成多管闲事了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0265_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_04_1037_039kon", "source_sha256": "ac73f9ae71c0926e06b3cb51308c8bdce864865ad6a4c00d3178b3dee358e3a2", "ja": "私、知らず知らずのうちにまつりちゃんを\n傷つけていないか、すこし心配になっちゃった。", "zh": "我有点担心，自己是不是在不知不觉中伤害了小祭。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0265_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_04_1038_p", "source_sha256": "ef329ddd90bc0d2d0358e42d45959a5ce4904905a4fc413697a03de174cc941c", "ja": "それは大丈夫だと思いますよ。まつりは、\n「うらやましい」と言ってたじゃないですか。", "zh": "我觉得那应该没问题。因为小祭不是说过“羡慕”吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0265_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_04_1039_039kon", "source_sha256": "e5a1bf3f586b6ea07e3d6d13703abcba20b6802e4b972e8c81eb61b877f60821", "ja": "私と妹のことね。\n確かに、そう言ってくれたけど……。", "zh": "你说的是我和妹妹吧。她确实是那么说过，可是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0265_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_04_1040_p", "source_sha256": "6b5e229bd821ff38e39b87581c8e3f9c6df7cc853db4e76f5457dcd1184da5e1", "ja": "はい。\nきっとあれはまつりの素直な気持ちで……。", "zh": "是的。\n我想，那一定是茉莉真实的心情……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0265_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_04_1041_p", "source_sha256": "06731f59689de9f10280ea7c68deccf4451b4ba2b043412f9bc4b1ed69891bc0", "ja": "このみさんになら、吐き出しても大丈夫。\nその信頼があるからこそ、出せた言葉だと思います。", "zh": "如果是对木实小姐，我觉得就算把心里话说出来也没关系。\n正因为有这份信任，才能说出这样的话。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0265_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_04_1042_039kon", "source_sha256": "817f7af0db3f9aa24a951bb09f35fa242e5e20d255abf5aef00c913b4525cc7f", "ja": "信頼……。\nそうね。そうだと、いいんだけど……。", "zh": "信赖……  \n是啊。要真是那样就好了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0265_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_04_1043_p", "source_sha256": "5fd8e8b4520ce02e3efd09ace1367301b362f6ac53b2f060988d7630847b6dd7", "ja": "（家族の問題に、定まった正解なんてない。\nだからこそ……時間をかけて、向き合おう）", "zh": "（关于家人的问题，并不存在一个确定的正确答案。正因如此……才更要花时间去面对。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
